      "summary": "In the middle parameter range d ≥ 4, ceil((d+2)/2) ≤ s ≤ d−1, and n ≥ 2(d+1), W_{d,s}(n) is at least choose(n−1,d)+choose(n−2(d+1−s)−2,2s−d−2).",
      "title": "Main lower-bound theorem",
