      "subtype": "star_perturbation",
      "summary": "With r=d+1−s, choose disjoint r-sets T,L and define C={1,2}∪T∪L and U=[n]∖C; replace the proper-L patterns {1}∪T∪Y in the 1-star by {2}∪T∪Y and include the final Y=L pattern.",
      "title": "Explicit perturbed-star pattern family",
